{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19926","headline":"与二三友秋宵会话清上人院 一 · 孟郊","name":"与二三友秋宵会话清上人院 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处山不幽，此中情又别。\n一僧敲一磬，七子吟秋月。\n激石泉韵清，寄枝风啸咽。\n泠然诸境静，顿觉浮累灭。\n扣寂兼探真，通宵讵能辍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}